---
Add an exit/close button to the sample browser panel.

Currently the browser can only be closed via the toolbar toggle.
Add an X button in the browser panel header.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Close button visible in top-right of sample browser panel
- [ ] Clicking it closes the browser (same as toolbar toggle)
- [ ] Browser state preserved when reopened

## Test Plan
- [ ] Open browser, click X, verify it closes
- [ ] Reopen browser, verify state (current directory) preserved
